flowchart TB
    U["Client / SDK"] --> API["EvalHub API + tenant authorization<br/>trusted provider / benchmark dispatch"]
    API -->|ordinary benchmark| JOB["Existing Kubernetes Job + sidecar"]
    API -->|sandbox required| REC["SandboxedEvaluation + TrustyAI reconciler<br/>durable lifecycle, status and finalizer"]
    subgraph P["Trusted platform module: gateway, identity, policy, recovery"]
        PS["Platform sandbox service<br/>workspace setup and attempt identity"]
        GW["OpenShell gateway + Kubernetes driver<br/>authenticated TLS and workspace RBAC"]
        ADM["Admission and namespace guardrails<br/>profile, ownership, quota, policy, storage, Kueue"]
        PS -->|workspace and primary creation| GW
        GW -->|validate effective requests| ADM
    end
    REC --> PS
    subgraph T["Trusted per-attempt services: outside evaluated code"]
        BR["Compatibility broker<br/>Kubernetes subset to OpenShell<br/>identity for this workspace only"]
        REL["Integration relay<br/>job-bound callbacks, credentials and results"]
    end
    PS -.->|issue attempt identity| BR
    BR -->|child and streaming operations| GW
    subgraph W["One ephemeral workspace / managed namespace per evaluation attempt"]
        SUP["Trusted OpenShell supervisors<br/>policy and credential mediation"]
        PRI["Untrusted primary evaluator<br/>one per sandbox-required benchmark"]
        CH["Untrusted child sandboxes<br/>bounded fan-out and lifetime"]
        RES["Enforced SCC / PSA, quota and network<br/>short-lived PVCs with verified deletion"]
        SUP <-->|authenticated sandbox protocol| PRI
        SUP <-->|authenticated sandbox protocol| CH
        PRI --- RES
        CH --- RES
    end
    GW -->|provision via Agent Sandbox controller| SUP
    ADM -.->|readiness before execution| RES
    PRI -->|attempt-authenticated requests| BR
    PRI -->|scoped events and artifacts| REL
    SUP -->|approved endpoint-bound requests| EXT["Model, judge and data endpoints"]
    REL --> STORE[("Tenant results / MLflow / OCI<br/>EvalHub callbacks")]
    classDef trusted fill:#edf3f7,stroke:#3d586b,color:#132c3b
    classDef untrusted fill:#fff3df,stroke:#8d6429,color:#453213
    class PS,GW,ADM,BR,REL,SUP trusted
    class PRI,CH untrusted
